				  "选择一款壁纸后，可在这里调整模糊、亮度、适配、倍速等效果": "Pick a wallpaper to adjust blur, brightness, fit, speed and other effects here",
				  "画面": "Picture",
				  "壁纸模糊": "Wallpaper blur",
				  "亮度": "Brightness",
				  "对比度": "Contrast",
				  "饱和度": "Saturation",
				  "壁纸透明度": "Wallpaper opacity",
				  "壁纸向原生底色淡出（浅色纯白 / 深色纯黑）；透明生效时壁纸层会垫这层原生底色，以保证玻璃模糊不被透明背景破坏。场景壁纸的垫底实时帧会在实时画面出场后退场，不会在淡出时透出来": "The wallpaper fades toward the native base color (pure white in light mode / pure black in dark mode); while transparency is active the wallpaper layer sits on this native base color so glass blur is not broken by a transparent background. For Scene wallpapers the backing live frame steps aside once live rendering takes over, so it never shows through during the fade",
				  "暗化": "Dimming",
				  "网页实时渲染": "Web live rendering",
				  "场景实时渲染": "Scene live rendering",
				  "WebGL 实时渲染 · 失败自动降级": "WebGL live rendering · falls back automatically on failure",
				  "网页壁纸由 WebWallGL 加载并注入 WE API（音频/属性监听等），严格沙箱隔离（不继承宿主权限）；加载失败或运行失联时自动退回兼容 iframe。重新开启会重试此前失败的壁纸": "Web wallpapers are loaded by WebWallGL with the WE API injected (audio / property listeners, etc.) in a strict sandbox (no inherited host privileges); if loading fails or the runtime goes silent it falls back to the compatibility iframe. Turning this back on retries previously failed wallpapers",
				  "场景壁纸由 WebWallGL 实时渲染（粒子/脚本/视差/包内音频）；加载失败或运行失联时自动退回内嵌视频 / 实时帧。重新开启会重试此前失败的壁纸": "Scene wallpapers are rendered live by WebWallGL (particles / scripts / parallax / audio in the package); if loading fails or the runtime goes silent it falls back to the embedded video / live frame. Turning this back on retries previously failed wallpapers",
				  "启动最长等待时间": "Max startup wait",
				  "立即": "Immediately",
				  "实时渲染帧率": "Live rendering frame rate",
				  "渲染 fps · 越低越省电": "Render fps · lower saves power",
				  "出图来源": "Frame source",
				  "这张画面从哪来": "Where this picture comes from",
				  "场景壁纸「这张画面从哪来」。两档：**实时画面**（有抓帧就用它，没有则留空）与**自定义画面**（手动导入的截图）。点一次切换一次，选择记忆在当前壁纸上。实时渲染生效时本行不显示（那时画面来自实时渲染，切这里不会生效）": "Scene wallpaper “where this picture comes from”. Two options: **Live frame** (used when a captured frame exists, otherwise left empty) and **Custom frame** (a manually imported screenshot). Each click switches once, and the choice is remembered per wallpaper. This row is hidden while live rendering is active (the picture then comes from live rendering, so switching here has no effect)",
				  "切换出图来源": "Switch frame source",
				  "切换": "Switch",
				  "第 {n}/{total} 档 · {label}": "Option {n}/{total} · {label}",
				  "实时帧": "Live frame",
				  "已抓帧 · 优先于全部画面档位": "Frame captured · takes priority over all picture options",
				  "实时渲染中 · 可随时抓一张": "Live rendering · capture a frame anytime",
				  "实时渲染成功后会自动抓帧缓存这一帧（<key>_gpu.png），它优先于「出图来源」的自动档；切换壁纸途中、以及 live 首帧出来之前，屏幕上显示的就是它。「重新截」会按**当前**画面重抓一张（已存在的缓存会被替换，抓不到则原样保留）；「清除 GPU 帧」删掉缓存、回到「自动」：没有实时画面时是空态（不再**合成**任何「猜」出来的图）；唯一的例外是该帧连**加载都失败**、而壁纸有工程预览图时，退到预览图垫底（作者随包发布的图）。": "Live rendering captures and caches this frame automatically on success (<key>_gpu.png), and it takes priority over the Auto tier in Frame source; it is what you see on screen while switching wallpapers and before the first live frame arrives. Recapture grabs a fresh frame from the **current** view (an existing cache is replaced; if the capture fails, the old one is kept as is); Clear GPU frame deletes the cache and returns to Auto: with no live frame the slot stays empty (no more **synthesizing** a guessed image). The only exception: if the frame fails even to **load** and the wallpaper has a project preview image, it falls back to that preview (an image shipped by the author).",
				  "当前壁纸实时帧预览": "Live frame preview for the current wallpaper",
				  "当前壁纸的实时帧（就是切换途中 / live 首帧前显示的那张静帧）{size}": "The current wallpaper's live frame (the static frame shown mid-switch / before the first live frame){size}",
				  "重新截取当前壁纸实时帧": "Recapture the current wallpaper's live frame",
				  "抓帧中…": "Capturing…",
				  "重新截": "Recapture",
				  "清除 GPU 实时帧缓存": "Clear the cached GPU live frame",
				  "清除中…": "Clearing…",
				  "清除 GPU 帧": "Clear GPU frame",
				  "手动给电脑桌面截图，导入截图解决错误壁纸": "Manually screenshot your desktop, then import it to fix a wrong wallpaper",
				  "手动对电脑桌面截图（壁纸显示效果的分辨率即最终展示画质），再回来点「导入画面…」选中该截图；导入后自动切换为该图，可随时切回「实时画面」档。实时渲染生效时它仍会作为「出图来源」的自定义档": "Manually screenshot your desktop (the resolution the wallpaper is displayed at is the final quality), then come back and click Import frame… to select that screenshot; after importing it switches to that image automatically, and you can switch back to the Live frame tier at any time. While live rendering is active it still serves as the Custom tier in Frame source.",
