				  "Edge 下视频壁纸走 canvas 渲染": "Video wallpapers render via canvas in Edge",
				  "Edge 兼容：视频壁纸改用 canvas 渲染，避免浏览器自带的「下载 / 投屏」悬浮工具栏；关闭则始终使用原生 <video>": "Edge compatibility: video wallpapers render via canvas instead, avoiding the browser's built-in download / cast floating toolbar; when off, the native <video> is always used",
				  "适配目标决定四件事：网页壁纸载荷走哪个源（有无能力头栅栏）、桌面壳材质规则是否生效、窗口失焦暂停是否适用、面板哪些行可用。默认自动检测，检测不准时可手选覆盖（手选优先）。": "The adapter target decides four things: which origin serves web wallpaper payloads (whether a capability-header gate exists), whether desktop shell material rules apply, whether pause-on-blur is available, and which panel rows are usable. Auto-detect is the default; if detection is wrong, pick a target manually to override it (manual wins).",
				  "适配目标": "Adapter target",
				  "自动检测 · 手选可覆盖": "Auto-detect · manual override",
				  "检测到：{target}{suffix}": "Detected: {target}{suffix}",
				  " · 有能力头栅栏（网页壁纸走独立媒体源）": " · capability-header gate present (web wallpapers use the dedicated media origin)",
				  " · 无栅栏的桌面形态（网页壁纸仍走独立媒体源）": " · desktop shell without a gate (web wallpapers still use the dedicated media origin)",
				  " · 无栅栏（网页壁纸走应用源）": " · no gate (web wallpapers use the app origin)",
				  "类似 WE 的遮挡暂停：最小化、切到其它应用或使用电池供电时视频暂停、GPU 解码归零；回到界面 / 接通电源自动继续（网页壁纸仅随页面隐藏被浏览器节流）": "WE-like occlusion pause: video pauses and GPU decoding drops to zero when minimized, switched to another app, or on battery; it resumes automatically when you return / plug in (web wallpapers are only throttled by the browser while the page is hidden)",
				  "省电": "Power saving",
				  "最小化/切页时暂停": "Pause when minimized / switched away",
				  "窗口失焦时暂停": "Pause when the window loses focus",
				  "「窗口失焦时暂停」只在原生浏览器目标下提供 —— 桌面壳失焦时壁纸仍可见，暂停会定格可见画面{note}": "\"Pause when the window loses focus\" is only offered for the plain browser target — in a desktop shell the wallpaper stays visible when the window is unfocused, so pausing would freeze a visible frame{note}",
				  "（当前已开启，本目标下不生效，切到浏览器目标后恢复）": "(currently enabled, but has no effect for this target; it takes effect again on the browser target)",
				  "使用电池时暂停": "Pause on battery",
				  "实时渲染诊断": "Live rendering diagnostics",
				  "live 诊断日志": "Live diagnostic log",
				  "本会话有效 · 逐秒心跳读数": "This session only · per-second heartbeat readings",
				  "开启后每秒记录一次渲染页心跳读数（fps / running / 暂停原因）与准备、领养、判失败事件；同时写入浏览器控制台和宿主诊断缓冲（GET /wallpaper-engine/diag-log）。排查 live 掉帧/降级时用，平时关着。": "When enabled, the render page's heartbeat readings (fps / running / pause reason) are logged once a second, along with prepare, adopt, and failure events; Also writes to the browser console and the host diagnostic buffer (GET /wallpaper-engine/diag-log). Use it when troubleshooting live frame drops or degradation; leave it off otherwise.",

