				  "🎉 v1.3.2 更新：视频秒开 · 壁纸取景 · 缓存搬家": "🎉 v1.3.2 update: instant video start · wallpaper framing · cache on your terms",
				  "求个 star 喵！—— GitHub 求星插画": "“Give us a star, meow!” — the GitHub star-plea art",
